<div class="gap-bottom-equal edu-about-area about-style-9" style="background:#0060ff2e; padding: 60px 10px;">
    <div class="container edublink-animated-shape">
        <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">

            <div class="col-lg-8">
                <div class="about-content">
                    <div class="section-title section-left sal-animate" data-sal-delay="150" data-sal="slide-up" data-sal-duration="800">
                        <h2 class="title">Why Choose Canada for Study?</h2>
                        <span class="shape-line"><i class="icon-19"></i></span>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="features-list sal-animate" data-sal-delay="150" data-sal="slide-up" data-sal-duration="800">
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Academic Excellence
                            <p class="fs-5">Getting a degree from a Canadian university is a sign of trust and excellence. Most of the universities are in QS World Ranking and World University Rankings.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Ample Research Opportunities
                            <p class="fs-5">For research scholars, Canada is the best country. You can access high facilities and collaborate with leading industry experts and engage in innovative research projects.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Affordable Falls in the Budget
                            <p class="fs-5">As compared to other countries, Canada is cost effective. The quality of education is high and living costs are budget-friendly.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Cultural Diversity
                            <p class="fs-5">People in Canada are from multiple ethnic groups, which shows a rich blend of cultures and backgrounds. Here you can build global networks, and develop better communication skills.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Safe and peaceful
                            <p class="fs-5">Canada is ranked eleventh in the list of Global Peace Index 2024. Enjoy peace of mind knowing you are in a very safe and peaceful country, allowing full study focus.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Earn While You Learn
                            <p class="fs-5">Students are allowed to work part-time for 20 hours during studies and work full-time during vacations. Gain practical experience and ease financial burdens.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Vibrant Campus Life
                            <p class="fs-5">Experience a dynamic campus with diverse sports, and social events. Engage in activities beyond academics, fostering personal growth and extensive networking opportunities.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Immigration Opportunities
                            <p class="fs-5"> Canada's Post-Graduation Work Permit Program (PGWPP) allows you to stay and work for up to three years after graduation to gain international experience.</p>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

